------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The cryptographic core in `packages/sdk/` was originally written by the same
author inside the Cluster project (Oppia Software Labs) and is re-published here
under Apache-2.0. Only files authored solely by aguilar1x were carried over,
verified per-file against the source repository's git history. No third-party
contributor's code from that project is included.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Specifications implemented
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project implements client obligations defined by OpenZeppelin's
Confidential Tokens specifications:

  - SDK.md
    https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/stellar-contracts/blob/main/packages/tokens/src/confidential/docs/SDK.md
  - INDEXER.md
    https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/stellar-contracts/blob/main/packages/tokens/src/confidential/docs/INDEXER.md

Those specifications are authored by OpenZeppelin and are not covered by this
project's copyright. This project is an independent implementation and is not
endorsed by or affiliated with OpenZeppelin.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party dependencies
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Proving is performed by Aztec's Barretenberg (`@aztec/bb.js`) and Noir
(`@noir-lang/noir_js`), and field/curve/hash primitives come from the Noble
libraries (`@noble/curves`, `@noble/hashes`, `@noble/ciphers`) and
`@zkpassport/poseidon2`. Each is distributed under its own license; see the
respective packages for details.
